# Architecture

## Overview

{{ project_name }} is a full-stack web application using Next.js.

## Project Structure

```
src/
  app/                   # Next.js App Router
    layout.tsx           # Root layout
    page.tsx             # Home page
    api/health/route.ts  # Health endpoint
  components/            # React components
{%- if include_shadcn %}
    ui/                  # shadcn/ui components
{%- endif %}
  hooks/                 # Custom React hooks
  lib/                   # Utilities and configuration
    api.ts               # API client utilities
    config.ts            # zod-based env/config validation
    logging.ts           # pino setup
    telemetry.ts         # OpenTelemetry setup
  services/              # Business logic
{%- if include_database %}
  db.ts                  # Prisma client setup
  repositories/          # Data access layer
{%- endif %}
tests/
  unit/                  # Vitest unit tests
  integration/           # Vitest integration tests
  e2e/                   # Playwright e2e tests
```

## Toolchain

| Tool | Purpose |
| ---- | ------- |
| Node.js | Runtime |
| pnpm | Package manager |
| Next.js | Full-stack React framework |
| TypeScript | Type system |
| Biome | Formatting and linting |
| Tailwind CSS | Styling |
| Vitest | Unit and integration testing |
| Playwright | E2e testing |
| OpenTelemetry | Distributed tracing |
| pino | Structured logging |
| zod | Config/env validation |
{%- if include_database %}
| Prisma | ORM and database access |
{%- endif %}

## Conventions

- All configuration is in `package.json` and `tsconfig.json`.
- Health endpoint is available at `/api/health`.
- Strict TypeScript mode is enabled.
